            <ArticleTitle>[24-hour dynamics of electric ventricular systole in patients with arterial hypertension and obesity: gender peculiarities].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>239-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The features of 24-hour dynamics of the corrected electric ventricular systole and QT-interval dispersion were investigated in patients with stage II arterial hypertension and overweight or obesity, according to a gender. Gender distinctions of investigated criteria's were established, which depend on the body mass index.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
